{"term":{"label":"愛","occurrences":7,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"7B","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-ii","title":"盡心下","description":"孟子曰：「不仁哉，梁惠王也！仁者以其所愛及其所不愛，不仁者以其所不愛及其所愛。」\n公孫丑問曰：「何謂也？」\n「梁惠王以土地之故，糜爛其民而戰之，大敗，將復之，恐不能勝，故驅其所愛子弟以殉之，是之謂以其所不愛及其所愛也。」\n孟子曰：「《春秋》無義戰。彼善於此，則有之矣。征者上伐下也，敵國不相征也。」\n孟子曰：「盡信《書》"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"下","id":"下"},{"form":"仁","id":"仁"},{"form":"今","id":"今"},{"form":"信","id":"信"},{"form":"國","id":"國"},{"form":"天","id":"天"},{"form":"子","id":"子"},{"form":"心","id":"心"},{"form":"愛","id":"愛"},{"form":"民","id":"民"},{"form":"父","id":"父"},{"form":"王","id":"王"},{"form":"用","id":"用"},{"form":"至","id":"至"},{"form":"行","id":"行"},{"form":"諸","id":"諸"}],"edges":[{"weight":1.8055527913603908,"source":"諸","target":"天"},{"weight":1.6877697557040074,"source":"諸","target":"子"},{"weight":2.093234863812172,"source":"諸","target":"信"},{"weight":0.706940502692281,"source":"信","target":"仁"},{"weight":1.1124056108004454,"source":"信","target":"國"},{"weight":1.7647307968401356,"source":"用","target":"民"},{"weight":1.1769441319380167,"source":"用","target":"子"},{"weight":1.7647307968401356,"source":"用","target":"父"},{"weight":0.8892620594862357,"source":"用","target":"仁"},{"weight":0.5527898228650229,"source":"仁","target":"王"},{"weight":1.8055527913603908,"source":"仁","target":"愛"},{"weight":0.994622575144062,"source":"仁","target":"下"},{"weight":1.1124056108004454,"source":"仁","target":"天"},{"weight":0.706940502692281,"source":"仁","target":"至"},{"weight":1.5178707189086098,"source":"仁","target":"國"},{"weight":0.30147539458411676,"source":"仁","target":"子"},{"weight":0.8892620594862357,"source":"仁","target":"父"},{"weight":1.5824092400461809,"source":"至","target":"心"},{"weight":1.9390841839849136,"source":"至","target":"王"},{"weight":1.8055527913603908,"source":"至","target":"今"},{"weight":1.4282585602189228,"source":"民","target":"王"},{"weight":1.2947271675944,"source":"民","target":"天"},{"weight":1.1769441319380167,"sou